# .env backups. Three of these were committed (195f9d6, 4b5b965) because the
# ignore rule matched only the exact name `.env` - a timestamped copy made
# before editing it sailed straight past and carried the live credentials
# into a public repository.
.env.bak*
.env.*.bak
*.env.backup
